{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Build ONE Shopify Online Store 2.0 section (single .liquid file) named "Bamboo Hero Banner" that recreates the attached reference banner. We'll build it in 6 steps; this is STEP 1. Return only the full code.
    
    RULES (apply to all steps):
    - Font: Montserrat ONLY (Google Fonts link, weights 300-800). No font_picker, no theme fonts.
    - Nothing hardcoded: all text, colors, sizes, weights, spacing, links, show/hide toggles are settings with defaults.
    - All text fields are richtext (CTA label is plain text). Single-line richtext: strip <p> with replace '</p><p>' with '<br>', remove '<p>' and '</p>'.
    - <strong> inside richtext uses that element's own bold weight and accent color settings.
    - CSS scoped to section id, prefix "mbh-", settings mapped to CSS variables. No JS, no external CSS.
    - Mobile below 750px, desktop 990px+, fluid clamp() in between.
    - Group settings with headers. Valid schema JSON, unique ids, add a preset.
    - Empty text or image: render nothing.
    
    STEP 1:
    Full-bleed section, aspect ~16:9, min-height setting (default 760px). Background image fills it (object-fit cover, focal point, srcset, eager-load checkbox) with an optional color overlay (default 0%). Separate optional mobile image. Fallback bg color #F3E9DD. Keep the center ~38% of the width empty (the baby is in the photo).
    Settings: bg_image, bg_image_mobile, bg_color, overlay color + opacity, eager_load, desktop height, horizontal padding (desktop 88 / mobile 20), content top offset (80), content max-width (560), mobile text align, margin top/bottom.
    STEP 2 of 6. Update the existing section; keep everything already built. Same rules as before. Return full code.
    
    Add a top-left text block (max-width 560px, left padding 88px, top offset 80px), stacked:
    1. EYEBROW: uppercase, letter-spacing 0.30em, 12px, weight 500, color #3A3A3A. On the same row, a thin line after the text (80px x 1px, color #8F8A80, 28px gap, vertically centered). Default: "Clothes for Little Tomorrows".
    2. HEADING (selectable h1/h2/h3/div): default <p><strong>Softer Days</strong><br>for a Brighter Tomorrow</p>. Regular part: weight 400, color #2B2B2B. Bold part: weight 700, color #4A5738. Size 64px desktop / 36px mobile, line-height 1.15, letter-spacing -0.01em, 24px margin below.
    3. SUBTEXT: max-width 470px, 18px / 15px mobile, weight 400, color #3A3A3A, line-height 1.5. Default: "Thoughtfully designed baby essentials in a breathable bamboo blend, for happy little moments and a kinder planet."
    
    Settings for EACH element: show toggle, richtext, size desktop/mobile, weight, color, line-height, letter-spacing, margin. Heading also: tag, bold weight, bold color. Eyebrow also: uppercase toggle, line toggle/width/thickness/color/gap.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign mbh_id = section.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign eyebrow = section.settings.eyebrow_text | replace: '</p><p>', '<br>' | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' %}
{% assign heading = section.settings.heading_text | replace: '</p><p>', '<br>' | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' %}
{% assign subtext = section.settings.subtext_text | replace: '</p><p>', '<br>' | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% style %}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }}{--mbh-bg:{{ section.settings.bg_color }};--mbh-overlay:{{ section.settings.overlay_color }};--mbh-overlay-opacity:{{ section.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by:100.0 }};--mbh-height:{{ section.settings.desktop_height }}px;--mbh-pad-x:{{ section.settings.horizontal_padding_desktop }}px;--mbh-top:{{ section.settings.content_top_offset }}px;--mbh-max-width:{{ section.settings.content_max_width }}px;--mbh-e-size:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-e-weight:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_weight }};--mbh-e-color:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};--mbh-rule-width:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_width }}px;--mbh-rule-height:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_thickness }}px;--mbh-rule-color:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_color }};--mbh-rule-gap:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_gap }}px;--mbh-h-size:{{ section.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-h-weight:{{ section.settings.heading_weight }};--mbh-h-color:{{ section.settings.heading_color }};--mbh-h-bold-weight:{{ section.settings.heading_bold_weight }};--mbh-h-bold-color:{{ section.settings.heading_bold_color }};--mbh-h-line:{{ section.settings.heading_line_height }};--mbh-h-spacing:{{ section.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}em;--mbh-s-size:{{ section.settings.subtext_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-s-weight:{{ section.settings.subtext_weight }};--mbh-s-color:{{ section.settings.subtext_color }};--mbh-s-line:{{ section.settings.subtext_line_height }};--mbh-align:{{ section.settings.mobile_text_align }};width:100%;margin-block:{{ section.settings.margin_top }}px {{ section.settings.margin_bottom }}px;font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;min-height:var(--mbh-height);aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:var(--mbh-bg)}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__media,#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__media{object-fit:cover}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__overlay{background:var(--mbh-overlay);opacity:var(--mbh-overlay-opacity);pointer-events:none}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__content{position:relative;z-index:1;box-sizing:border-box;width:min(var(--mbh-max-width),100%);margin-left:var(--mbh-pad-x);padding-top:var(--mbh-top);text-align:left}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--mbh-rule-gap);margin:0 0 {{ section.settings.eyebrow_margin }}px;color:var(--mbh-e-color);font-size:var(--mbh-e-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-e-weight);line-height:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_height }};letter-spacing:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}em;text-transform:{% if section.settings.eyebrow_uppercase %}uppercase{% else %}none{% endif %}}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow__rule{display:{% if section.settings.eyebrow_line_show %}block{% else %}none{% endif %};flex:0 0 var(--mbh-rule-width);height:var(--mbh-rule-height);background:var(--mbh-rule-color)}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{margin:0 0 {{ section.settings.heading_margin }}px;color:var(--mbh-h-color);font-size:var(--mbh-h-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-h-weight);line-height:var(--mbh-h-line);letter-spacing:var(--mbh-h-spacing)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading strong{color:var(--mbh-h-bold-color);font-weight:var(--mbh-h-bold-weight)}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{max-width:{{ section.settings.subtext_max_width }}px;margin:0 0 {{ section.settings.subtext_margin }}px;color:var(--mbh-s-color);font-size:var(--mbh-s-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-s-weight);line-height:var(--mbh-s-line);letter-spacing:{{ section.settings.subtext_letter_spacing }}em}
@media(min-width:750px) and (max-width:989px){#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner{min-height:clamp(520px,76vw,var(--mbh-height))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__content{margin-left:clamp(32px,8vw,var(--mbh-pad-x));padding-top:clamp(44px,8vw,var(--mbh-top));width:min(var(--mbh-max-width),54vw)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,var(--mbh-h-size))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{font-size:clamp(11px,1.4vw,var(--mbh-e-size))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{font-size:clamp(16px,1.8vw,var(--mbh-s-size))}}
@media(max-width:749px){#mbh-{{ mbh_id }}{--mbh-pad-x:{{ section.settings.horizontal_padding_mobile }}px;--mbh-h-size:{{ section.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;--mbh-e-size:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_size_mobile }}px;--mbh-s-size:{{ section.settings.subtext_size_mobile }}px}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner{min-height:min(var(--mbh-height),{{ section.settings.mobile_height }}px);aspect-ratio:auto}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__content{width:100%;margin:0;padding:{{ section.settings.mobile_content_top }}px var(--mbh-pad-x) 32px;text-align:var(--mbh-align)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__media--desktop{display:{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}none{% else %}block{% endif %}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-banner__media--mobile{display:{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}block{% else %}none{% endif %}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{justify-content:{% if section.settings.mobile_text_align == 'center' %}center{% elsif section.settings.mobile_text_align == 'right' %}flex-end{% else %}flex-start{% endif %}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,var(--mbh-h-size))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{margin-left:{% if section.settings.mobile_text_align == 'center' %}auto{% else %}0{% endif %};margin-right:{% if section.settings.mobile_text_align == 'center' %}auto{% else %}0{% endif %}}}
{% endstyle %}
<section id="mbh-{{ mbh_id }}" class="mbh-section" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}><div class="mbh-banner">
{% if section.settings.bg_image != blank %}<img class="mbh-banner__media mbh-banner__media--desktop" src="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}" srcset="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w, {{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2400 }} 2400w" sizes="100vw" alt="{{ section.settings.bg_image.alt | escape }}" width="{{ section.settings.bg_image.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.bg_image.height }}" style="object-position:{{ section.settings.bg_image.presentation.focal_point | default: '50% 50%' }}" {% if section.settings.eager_load %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}<img class="mbh-banner__media mbh-banner__media--mobile" src="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1200 }}" srcset="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 450 }} 450w, {{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w" sizes="100vw" alt="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.alt | escape }}" width="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.height }}" style="object-position:{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.presentation.focal_point | default: '50% 50%' }}" {% if section.settings.eager_load %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.overlay_opacity > 0 %}<div class="mbh-banner__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.eyebrow_show or section.settings.heading_show or section.settings.subtext_show %}<div class="mbh-banner__content">{% if section.settings.eyebrow_show and eyebrow != blank %}<div class="mbh-eyebrow"><span>{{ eyebrow }}</span><span class="mbh-eyebrow__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>{% endif %}{% if section.settings.heading_show and heading != blank %}<{{ section.settings.heading_tag }} class="mbh-heading">{{ heading }}</{{ section.settings.heading_tag }}>{% endif %}{% if section.settings.subtext_show and subtext != blank %}<div class="mbh-subtext">{{ subtext }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}</div></section>
{% schema %}
